tc qdisc add dev $DSLDEV parent 1:20 handle 20: sfq perturb 10
tc qdisc add dev $DSLDEV parent 1:30 handle 30: sfq perturb 10
tc qdisc add dev $DSLDEV parent 1:40 handle 40: sfq perturb 10
